flowchart LR
  Customer([Customer Browser]) -->|HTTPS| CDN[CloudFront CDN]
  CDN --> APIGW[API Gateway]
  subgraph AWS Cloud
    APIGW --> Orders[Orders Lambda]
    Orders -->|write| DB[(Orders DynamoDB)]
    Orders -->|publish| Topic{{Order Events SNS}}
    Topic --> Queue[Fulfilment Queue]
    Queue --> Worker[Fulfilment Worker Function]
    Worker --> Bucket[(Receipts S3 Bucket)]
    Orders -.-> Logs[CloudWatch Logs]
  end
  Worker -.->|status| Payment[Payment Gateway]
